{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 能力仲裁｜流程子图\n只画申请到激活/拒绝的先后。类与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]]；[[计划_AbilitySystem]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. InputTag 或 ActionTag 形成能力激活请求。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 165,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "tag",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. ASC 检查基础激活条件和 Tag 关系映射。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 165,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "group",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ASC 按组规则、Exclusive 策略和优先级仲裁；同级按 D4。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 175,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "allow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4A. 允许：取消被压制实例，登记新能力所在组并激活 GA。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 175,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "reject",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4B. 拒绝：回传原因；可重试的玩家意图由 HeroComponent 缓冲。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "freed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 旧 GA 结束释放组；HeroComponent 收到通知再申请一次。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
